ship</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="0df58016-b2c8-4098-ac2e-2ee9073837b6" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-71_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-72_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-73_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-74_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-76_">By enrolling in the club, you are agreeing to receive two shipments of wine in March and October, at a 20% discount membership price.
<br><br>Membership entitles you to buy additional wine via the website, or direct from our winery at a members’ discount of 20%.  In addition, you will also get privileged access to reserve and limited edition wines at a 20% discount (subject to availability and allocation). You will also receive invitations to members events in London, Hong King or Lisbon as well as VIP tours and tastings at the vineyard and winery in Portugal.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-77_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-78_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="b2c81098-ac2e-4ee9-8738-37b6262318cb" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Shipping</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="b2c81098-ac2e-4ee9-8738-37b6262318cb" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-80_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-81_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-82_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-83_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-85_">We ship to most places in Portugal, the UK and Hong Kong.<br><br>There may be a small additional charge to ship to some rural locations. We are unable to ship to PO Box addresses.For shipping to other countries, please Contact Us for more information.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-86_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-87_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="ac2e2ee9-0738-47b6-a623-18cb2a39f6cf" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Amount of Wine</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="ac2e2ee9-0738-47b6-a623-18